      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0140_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "418BAD3474F803E2",
      "text": "Nous devons en finir.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0140_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "91A7AE3026A4C36F",
      "text": "En finir... ?\\nTu veux dire... dissoudre la Team Star ?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0140_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "418BAC3474F8022F",
      "text": "On est allés trop loin avec l’Opération Star.\\nLa situation est hors de contrôle...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0140_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "934D2E0669D4A7EB",
      "text": "C’est vrai qu’on a mis l’paquet en rassemblant\\ncette bande de harceleurs dans la cour...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0140_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "D56B8A961FF81062",
      "text": "Mais, en fin de compte, nous ne nous sommes\\nmême pas battus ![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0140_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "073576795B5C61BF",
      "text": "Nous avons exposé notre volonté ferme de nous\\nbattre, dussent leurs harcèlements perdurer.\\r\\nNotre victoire fut pacifique.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0140_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "6B377E0DEA0D2B99",
      "text": "C’est vrai qu’on a même pas eu besoin de sortir\\nnos Pokémon. Ils ont capitulé sur-le-champ.\\c\\nIls se sont excusés en pleurnichant, à croire\\nqu’on leur a fait peur dans nos nouvelles tenues.\\r\\nQuelle bande de bébés...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 218,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0140_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "418BAB3474F8007C",
      "text": "Mais après ça, tous ces élèves ont fui.\\c\\nLes évènements ont pris une ampleur démesurée,\\net on est tous impliqués.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0140_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "91A7AF3026A4C522",
      "text": "C’est vrai que ça craint...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0140_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "418BAA3474F7FEC9",
      "text": "... Mais je vais me charger de régler le problème.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0140_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "934D2F0669D4A99E",
      "text": "Hein ? De quoi tu parles ?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
